        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Central feature: a bird on a triangle perch flanked by oval medallions bearing landscape scenes. The surrounding grournd is filled with various flower baskets, floral, architectural and animal motives. In the lower left corner is a mounted huntsman; in the upper right an urn bearing the word \"souvenir\". Cream linen ground with polychrome silk yarns worked in cross stitch. Slightly soiled. Stitches: cross and eyelet"@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/a8425172-273c-3390-94a6-4a118b01a9c7> .

